#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:95
msgid "Quick answers about accounts, listings, photos and the verified badge."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:98
msgid "Questions, a listing to report or an account to upgrade? Write to us — we reply within one working day."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:432
msgid "What’s the difference between a Member, a Private Seller and a Business Seller?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:433
msgid "A Member browses, saves searches, chats with sellers and leaves reviews, but can’t post listings. A Private Seller does everything a Member does and posts listings as an individual. A Business Seller is the same for companies and tradespeople, and registers with the company’s NIF."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:436
msgid "Why does my account need approval?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:437
msgid "Every new account is checked by a person before it goes live — usually within 48 hours. It keeps fake sellers off the site. Confirm your e-mail address first; we write to you as soon as the account is approved."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:440
msgid "Does posting a listing cost anything?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:441
msgid "No. Posting and renewing are free for Private and Business Sellers, and there is no commission on what you sell."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:445
msgid "How long does a listing stay online?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:449
msgid "How do I renew a listing?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:453
msgid "Why is my listing “Pending review”?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:454
msgid "Every new listing — and every change to a live one — is checked before it shows on the site. You can follow its status under My account › My listings."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:457
msgid "What are the photo limits?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:458
msgid "Up to 5 photos per listing, in JPG, PNG or WebP, each up to 10 MB. The first photo is the cover; you can choose another one in the listing form."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:461
msgid "What is the verified seller badge?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:462
msgid "Sellers can upload an identity document in their account. An administrator checks it and, if it matches, the account gets the Verified badge. The document is deleted as soon as the decision is made — only the result is kept."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:465
msgid "How do I contact a seller?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:466
msgid "Each listing shows the seller’s phone and WhatsApp where they gave them. Chat and e-mail enquiries need a free account, so the seller always knows who is writing."
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:469
msgid "Can I get an e-mail when something new is listed?"
msgstr ""

#: inc/src/Modules/Content/Migrator.php:470
msgid "Yes. Search or filter the listings, then use “Save this search” and choose instantly, daily or weekly. You can change or stop each alert in your account, or with the link in every e-mail."
msgstr ""

